<section class="shell portfolio-section page-intro"><p class="overline">Research</p><h1>Notes from<br>the field.</h1><p>Sourced, dated articles on AI, web development, and the responsible use of both. Written to be read in a few minutes and checked against the numbers.</p></section>
<section class="shell portfolio-section notes-list">
{% set posts = collections.research | sort(false, false, "data.order") %}
{% for post in posts %}
<article data-enter><p class="project-type">{{ post.data.topic }} / {{ post.date | date_long }} / {{ post.templateContent | reading_time }} min read</p><h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }} ↗</a></h2><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read the article ↗</a></article>
{% endfor %}
</section>
